{"about_the_game":"You are RABBIT, a lonely survivor from an alien abduction, you don't know where you are, or why.<br><br>After waking up, you realize you aren't home, and that escaping is not an option.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THE BAD GUYS</strong></h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157230/extras/AllEnemiesGif.gif?t=1702417442\" /><br>In this bullet-hell journey, encounter more than 10 types of enemies (and more than a hundred of them).<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THE RUN KILLERS</strong></h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157230/extras/AllBosses.gif?t=1702417442\" /><br>Each map has a final boss, which has different mechanics, learn and try again.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>LOOT!</strong></h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157230/extras/ezgif.com-gif-maker.gif?t=1702417442\" /><br>With each chest you have an option to maximize your success, choose according to your run preference!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>LEVEL UP YOUR CARROT THROWING</strong></h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157230/extras/LevelUpsGif.gif?t=1702417442\" /><br>Over 10 Types of Upgrades, choose wisely or get lucky! <br><br>Variable maps and enemies, bosses, loot, everything!<br><br>Follow through the history as you progress,<br><br>Explore different builds and mechanics and more importantly, survive!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2157230?t=1702417442","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2157230?t=1702417442","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157230/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1702417442","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157230/capsule_1